  "intro": {
    "title": "Kann ich Ihnen helfen?",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Helfen is one of the verbs that take the dative: you help to someone. Kann ich Ihnen helfen? (Can I help you?), Hilf mir! (Help me!). It also changes e to i: du hilfst, er hilft."
    ]
